            "title": "蘋果CEO特努斯談iPhone Duo：「軟硬體一體」才是摺疊螢幕核心",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"蘋果CEO特努斯談iPhone Duo：「軟硬體一體」才是摺疊螢幕核心\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"541\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6b6fc4e54b4ed0daca95485da327d94aecd764766b7d5739119b154234d7ff59/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2Fd4d59484fb843d974b6e63fc5389719b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">蘋果CEO特努斯談iPhone Duo：「軟硬體一體」才是摺疊螢幕核心</figcaption></div></figure></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E8%98%8B%E6%9E%9Cceo%E7%89%B9%E5%8A%AA%E6%96%AF%E8%AB%87iphone-duo-%E8%BB%9F%E7%A1%AC%E9%AB%94-%E9%AB%94-%E6%89%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%91%BA%E7%96%8A%E8%9E%A2%E5%B9%95%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83-111003074.html",
